    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are capable of delivering jarring melee attacks.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can spend two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> in the same round to deal +1 die of damage on your next melee attack in the same round.</p><p><b>Special:</b> The effects of this Feat do not stack with the extra damage provided by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a> Feat.</p>",
